`ckpt/exp09/{sim2real/yawaug/**, stats.json, summary.txt}` (+ `_diag/` if the optional probe runs); record `worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_09_yawaug_haa_claude/` (`plan_yawaug_haa.md`, `yawaug_haa_yixun_query.md`, `yawaug_haa_worklog.md`, `yawaug_haa_command.md`, `commits_yawaug_haa.md`, `yawaug_haa_params_set_up.md`, Codex reviews, Coder reports, logs, `yawaug_haa_results.md`, `yawaug_haa_analysis.md`, `yawaug_haa_01_results.html` + generators); an exp_09 addendum table placing E next to A, B, C (sourced from `ckpt/exp09/stats.json`; exp_06's canonical JSON untouched).

