**Design and comparability.** The saved arguments confirm the claimed pretraining-budget match:

| Setting | Exp_01 control | Exp_04 yaw augmentation |
|---|---:|---:|
| Epochs | 12 | 12 |
| Microbatch × accumulation | 32 × 2 | 32 × 2 |
| LR / weight decay | 1e−3 / 1e−4 | Same |
