|---|---|---:|---:|---|
| Classroom | 2, 1, 2, 7 | 12.929 / 9.037 | N/A: sole candidate | −90°, `k=128` |
| Dampened | 4, 0, 3, 5 | 11.381 / 8.669 | 17.415 / 13.144 | −90°, `k=128` |
